stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> BOOTING
    BOOTING --> WINDOWS_SIGNED_IN: Windows sign-in complete
    WINDOWS_SIGNED_IN --> SPLITOS_CONTEXT_RESOLVING
    SPLITOS_CONTEXT_RESOLVING --> MODE_SELECTION: context resolved
    SPLITOS_CONTEXT_RESOLVING --> RECOVERY: context/baseline invalid
    MODE_SELECTION --> OPERATIONAL: initial mode committed
    OPERATIONAL --> RECOVERY: coherent runtime lost
    RECOVERY --> MODE_SELECTION: recovered before mode commit
    RECOVERY --> OPERATIONAL: coherent mode restored
    OPERATIONAL --> SHUTTING_DOWN: shutdown/sign-out
    MODE_SELECTION --> SHUTTING_DOWN: shutdown/sign-out
    RECOVERY --> SHUTTING_DOWN: shutdown/sign-out
    SHUTTING_DOWN --> [*]

