stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NONE
    NONE --> WORK: initial Work commit
    NONE --> GAME: initial Game commit
    WORK --> WORK: cancelled/rolled-back Work→Game
    WORK --> GAME: successful Work→Game commit
    GAME --> GAME: game exit / cancelled Game→Work
    GAME --> WORK: successful Game→Work commit
